        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Mechanically stable tailings impoundment. Closure with clay barrier and reduction of leachate flow for the initial 2000 years. Uranium production from in-situ leaching (ISL) is not heedded.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="1980-01-01" endDate="2007-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Time period: Average uranium tailings composition from literature references. Transfer coefficients from prospective model, specific to uranium tailings.</text>
        </comment>
      </timePeriod>
